# Demo requests, JetBrains HTTP client syntax (Rider, IntelliJ).
# Run them in order: each response handler stores the token or id the next request needs.
# Start the API first: dotnet run --project src/Mortgage.Api

@host = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Get a token (Development only)
POST {{host}}/dev/token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "demo" }

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.accessToken);
%}

### 2. Create the Approve application: loan 250,000 on a 300,000 property
POST {{host}}/api/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "annualIncome": 60000,
  "monthlyExpenses": 500,
  "depositAmount": 50000,
  "propertyValue": 300000,
  "termYears": 25
}

> {%
    client.global.set("approveId", response.body.id);
%}

### 3. Assess it now: LTV 83.3%, DTI 45.3%, Approved, max borrowing 270,000
POST {{host}}/api/applications/{{approveId}}/assessments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Create the Decline application: deposit 20,000, so the loan is 280,000
POST {{host}}/api/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "annualIncome": 60000,
  "monthlyExpenses": 500,
  "depositAmount": 20000,
  "propertyValue": 300000,
  "termYears": 25
}

> {%
    client.global.set("declineId", response.body.id);
%}

### 5. Assess it: Declined for two reasons, LTV 93.3% over 90% and loan over 4.5x income
POST {{host}}/api/applications/{{declineId}}/assessments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Missing field: no monthlyExpenses gives 400, not a silent 0
POST {{host}}/api/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "annualIncome": 60000,
  "depositAmount": 50000,
  "propertyValue": 300000,
  "termYears": 25
}

### 7. Queue an assessment: 202 Pending; the worker completes it (3 s delay in Development)
POST {{host}}/api/applications/{{approveId}}/assessments/queued
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

> {%
    client.global.set("assessmentId", response.body.id);
%}

### 8. Get the queued assessment: Pending at first, Completed a few seconds later
GET {{host}}/api/assessments/{{assessmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
